  "correctValue": "300",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>Fe</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>&#916;S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>550</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mole</mi></math></p><p>At equilibrium&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi>&#916;S</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;at equilibrium</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>165</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>550</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p>",
